  "description": "A high-performance Razor Class Library for Umbraco 17 (.NET 10) that integrates Instagram feeds using the official Instagram Graph API (v21.0).\n      Features automatic Umbraco dictionary item seeding through package migration and a startup notification handler that guarantees all required\n      dictionary keys exist (Instagram.AccessToken, Instagram.UserId, Instagram.Limit) without overwriting existing administrator values.\n      Includes a production-ready embedded partial view (Bootstrap 5 responsive grid with hover overlays, profile header, and graceful error states),\n      configurable post-count limiting via the Instagram.Limit dictionary key, zero-config dependency injection through InstagramComposer,\n      and strongly typed C# models for Instagram profile data and media items including images, reels, and carousel albums with captions,\n      like counts, comment counts, thumbnails, media URLs, and permalinks.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
